@startuml
allowmixing

title Plugin Architecture in SENSEI

left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
    BorderColor #303030
    ArrowColor #202020
}

skinparam package {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor #505050
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #707070
}

artifact "EvaML Application\n(XML)" as EvaML

component "ModuleLoader" as Loader

package "robot_package\n<<Plugin Repository>>" as RobotPackage {

    component "tag_module.py" as Module

    component "CommandHandler" as HandlerClass
}

collections "tab_modules" as Registry

EvaML --> Loader : used element tags

Loader ..> Module : dynamically imports

Module --> HandlerClass : provides

Loader --> Registry : registers module and\nhandler instance

Registry o--> HandlerClass : stores configured\ninstance

note bottom of Loader
For each EvaML element type,
ModuleLoader derives the module name
using the tag_module convention.
end note

note bottom of RobotPackage
A new EvaML element can be added
as an independent Python module
without modifying the execution engine.
end note

legend bottom
  <<Plugin Repository>>  Contains dynamically loadable modules
  ..>                    Dynamic module import
  -->                    Runtime processing or registration
  o-->                   Stores a configured instance
endlegend

@enduml